OL,3,AThai teen found in suitcase died from
OL,4,Asuffocation, police reveal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 17-year-old girl whose body was found
OL,7,Fin a suitcase in Thailand died from
OL,8,Fsuffocation, according to authorities.
OL,10,FPolice in the coastal city of Pattaya
OL,11,Fpreviously said they had found
OL,12,FTunchanok Donhomla's naked body in a
OL,13,Fbag near a railway track in the early
OL,14,Fhours of 27 June.
OL,16,FThis was just 15 minutes after they had
OL,17,Farrested 45-year-old Australian man
OL,18,FSimon Peter Carman, who was allegedly
OL,19,F"preparing to flee the country", they
OL,20,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
