OL,3,AThai teen found in suitcase died from
OL,4,Asuffocation, police reveal
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Wednesday, Pattaya City police chief
OL,7,FAnek Srathongyoo told the BBC that
OL,8,FTunchanok's autopsy results "showed she
OL,9,Fdied from suffocation".
